    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />

    <title>Savannah Woven Storage Basket | KASODI</title>

    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Discover the Savannah Woven Storage Basket by YAADU, selected by KASODI for its colourful handwoven design, natural savannah grass and versatile closed storage."
    />
  </head>

  <body>

    <Header />


    <main class="product-detail-page">

      <div class="product-breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <span>·</span>
        <a href="/home-organization">Home Organization</a>
        <span>·</span>
        <span>Savannah Woven Storage Basket</span>
      </div>


      <section class="product-detail-hero">

        <div class="product-detail-image">
          <img
            src="/images/home-organization/yaadu-savannah-woven-storage-basket.png"
            alt="Savannah Woven Storage Basket by YAADU styled by KASODI"
          />
        </div>


        <div class="product-detail-content">

          <p class="product-detail-eyebrow">
            KASODI EDIT · HOME ORGANIZATION
          </p>

          <h1>
            Savannah Woven Storage Basket
          </h1>

          <p class="product-detail-brand">
            YAADU
          </p>

          <p class="product-detail-intro">
            A colourful handwoven basket that makes practical storage feel
            decorative. Made from savannah grass and recycled plastic, its
            graphic bands of colour bring warmth and character to shelves,
            bathroom counters and kitchen surfaces while the fitted lid keeps
            everyday essentials neatly out of sight.
          </p>


          <div class="product-detail-divider"></div>


          <div class="product-detail-meta">

            <div>
              <span>Material</span>
              <strong>Savannah grass · Recycled plastic</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Size</span>
              <strong>32 × 24 × 12.5 cm</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Weight</span>
              <strong>Approx. 1 kg</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Colour</span>
              <strong>Natural · Multicolour</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Shape</span>
              <strong>Round</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Closure</span>
              <strong>Fitted lid · Magnetic</strong>
            </div>

          </div>


          <div class="affiliate-action">

            <a
              href="https://amzn.to/4cOB2yZ"
              target="_blank"
              rel="nofollow sponsored"
              class="product-shop-button"
            >
              Find It Here →
            </a>

            <p class="affiliate-note">
              Affiliate link · KASODI may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
            </p>

          </div>

        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="why-we-love">

        <div class="why-we-love-label">
          KASODI NOTE
        </div>

        <div class="why-we-love-content">

          <h2>Why we love it</h2>

          <p>
            Storage can be one of the easiest ways to introduce colour without
            changing the whole room. We like this basket because the vivid
            turquoise, green, yellow and red details are balanced by the natural
            woven base, giving it personality while still feeling grounded and
            easy to live with.
          </p>

          <p>
            The fitted lid makes it particularly useful for the small things we
            would rather keep out of sight — bathroom essentials, accessories,
            textiles or everyday kitchen items. Traditionally handwoven in
            Africa, the slight variations in the braiding also mean that each
            basket has its own individual character.
          </p>

        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="product-care">

        <p class="product-detail-eyebrow">
          CARE
        </p>

        <h2>Simple care for natural fibres</h2>

        <p>
          Clean gently with a dry or slightly damp cloth when needed. Avoid
          soaking the basket and allow any moisture to dry naturally to help
          preserve the woven savannah grass and colourful braided finish.
        </p>

      </section>


      <section class="styling-ideas">

        <div class="styling-heading">
          <p>KASODI STYLING</p>
          <h2>Style it with</h2>
        </div>


        <div class="styling-grid">

          <div class="styling-card">
            <span>01</span>
            <h3>Warm Wood</h3>
            <p>
              Place the basket on a natural oak or aged wooden surface to soften
              its brighter colours and emphasise the handmade woven texture.
            </p>
          </div>


          <div class="styling-card">
            <span>02</span>
            <h3>Natural Linen</h3>
            <p>
              Ivory, oatmeal and softly striped linen create a quiet neutral
              backdrop for the basket's colourful pattern.
            </p>
          </div>


          <div class="styling-card">
            <span>03</span>
            <h3>Simple Ceramics</h3>
            <p>
              Pair it with understated cream or earthy ceramics so the woven
              pattern remains the most expressive element in the arrangement.
            </p>
          </div>

        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="continue-exploring">

        <div class="continue-exploring-heading">
          <p>HOME ORGANIZATION</p>
          <h2>Continue Exploring</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="continue-exploring-grid">


          <a
            href="/home-organization/woven-rattan-organizer-tray"
            class="continue-card"
          >

            <div class="continue-card-image">
              <img
                src="/images/home-organization/wocpvm-woven-rattan-organizer-tray.png"
                alt="Woven Rattan Organizer Tray"
              />
            </div>

            <div class="continue-card-info">
              <span>HOME ORGANIZATION</span>
              <h3>Woven Rattan Organizer Tray</h3>
              <p>wocpvm</p>
              <strong>Discover →</strong>
            </div>

          </a>


          <a
            href="/home-organization/textured-oval-organizer-tray"
            class="continue-card"
          >

            <div class="continue-card-image">
              <img
                src="/images/home-organization/blissilk-textured-oval-organizer-tray.png"
                alt="Textured Oval Organizer Tray"
              />
            </div>

            <div class="continue-card-info">
              <span>HOME ORGANIZATION</span>
              <h3>Textured Oval Organizer Tray</h3>
              <p>Blissilk</p>
              <strong>Discover →</strong>
            </div>

          </a>


          <a
            href="/bathroom/amber-glass-apothecary-jars"
            class="continue-card"
          >

            <div class="continue-card-image">
              <img
                src="/images/bathroom/kuishi-amber-glass-apothecary-jars.png"
                alt="Amber Glass Apothecary Jars"
              />
            </div>

            <div class="continue-card-info">
              <span>BATHROOM</span>
              <h3>Amber Glass Apothecary Jars</h3>
              <p>Kuishi</p>
              <strong>Discover →</strong>
            </div>

          </a>

        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="product-final-cta">

        <p class="product-detail-eyebrow">
          YAADU · SAVANNAH WOVEN BASKET
        </p>

        <h2>
          Beautiful storage with a little more character.
        </h2>

        <a
          href="https://amzn.to/4cOB2yZ"
          target="_blank"
          rel="nofollow sponsored"
          class="product-shop-button"
        >
          Find It Here →
        </a>

        <p class="affiliate-note affiliate-note-light">
          Affiliate link · KASODI may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
        </p>

      </section>

    </main>


    <Footer />

  </body>
</html>